a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Hex_(Wisdom)\" title=\"Reapply Hex (Wisdom)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp/40px-Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp/60px-Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp/80px-Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reapply Hex (Wisdom)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp/40px-Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Reapply_Hex_Wisdom_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Hex_(Wisdom)\" title=\"Reapply Hex (Wisdom)\">Reapply Hex (Wisdom)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Hex_(Charisma)\" title=\"Reapply Hex (Charisma)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp/40px-Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp/60px-Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp/80px-Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reapply Hex (Charisma)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp/40px-Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Reapply_Hex_Charisma_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Hex_(Charisma)\" title=\"Reapply Hex (Charisma)\">Reapply Hex (Charisma)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by spells:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/25px-Hex_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/38px-Hex_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/50px-Hex_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/25px-Hex_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\">Hex</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reapply Hex is not classified as a spell and thus will not interact with any spell-specific effects such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/30px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/40px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wi